\label{lemma-intersect-normal}
Let $F$ be a field. Let $M/F$ be an algebraic extension. Let
$M/E_i/F$, $i \in I$ be subextensions with
$E_i/F$ normal. Then $\bigcap E_i$ is normal over $F$.
\end{lemma}
